# 50-50 the ledge, ollie off halfway, kickflip, land: one combo "50-50 + Kickflip".
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
hold ollie 230..250
tap flip+left 254
bot balance
run 560
expect event grindEnd{trick=BS 50-50,reason=ollie} within 249..253
expect event pop within 249..253
expect event trickEnd{trick=Kickflip} within 290..310
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + Kickflip,multiplier=2} within 300..460
expect no event bail
